bastard who liked to chop up old men with a hatchet. We got there too late. These fucks were already in residence, violating our perp like animals. They hadn't even put him out of his misery. I threw up harder than I ever have before and when I looked up, she'd shot every last one of them. She said self-defense. With the look in her eyes I didn't argue.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-18T19:02:20-08:00","id":1034397,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1022153-scariest-fucker?p=1029078#post1029078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To me, it's Changelings, Their powers is terrifying, they can make anyone go complete insane just tby showing up. People's minds are like putting on their hands, no one is safe if they want to they can make you a killer, make you gave everything you won to them, or just leave you as a terrifyed mess on the floor. And most important, they have reasons to do it. They alll have a target on their backs and almost all of them are prepared to anything to not go back, they're prepared to destroy anyone who gets on the way<br /> <br /> Prometheans are a close second,ironically most of the things that makes them scary are not really their fault. First there's the fact all of them were made by people who were mad, only a obsessed broken human being creates Prometheans. And obviously, all prometheans only exist becauase someone died to make them, they are wearing the body of murdered people. And aboce all there's torment. Torment can turn even th emost compassionate of them into a murderous monster nd tunring all the love and compassion they feel into rage</div> </div> </div> </div> If a Changeling really wants to screw with you in 2e, it just makes two Goblin Vows with the right aspect of reality, 1 vow gets you as a retainer merit and the gets the merit is, True Friend: You, you now can't betray them and most obey them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-18T19:03:56-08:00","id":1034400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1022153-scariest-fucker?p=1034327#post1034327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">pg. 72 <i>&amp;quot;Ashwood Abbey: My partner came from NYPD Special Victims. She'd dealt with sex-crime victims, abused kids, the worst shit you can imagine. We were after a bastard who liked to chop up old men with a hatchet. We got there too late. These fucks were already in residence, violating our perp like animals. They hadn't even put him out of his misery. I threw up harder than I ever have before and when I looked up, she'd shot every last one of them. She said self-defense. With the look in her eyes I didn't argue.&amp;quot;</i></div> </div> </div> </div> Yeah as far mortals go Ashwood Abby is up there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T02:50:31-08:00","id":1034493,"title":"","content":"Hmm, fear is not really an emotion much familiar to me, except for the rational, pragmatic kind, so I have difficulty to relate to this subject, but I can try. I think I'd be mostly scared of those supernaturals that harm or kill people seemingly at random for no apparent good reason, like slashers, or are mindless or with no self control, like the draugr, or try to ruin the world, such as the Scelesti or the Seers. Otherwise, several supernatural splats fascinate, not scare, me because of their power, potential for immortality, and awareness about the true nature of the universe, more or less the same way people are often fascinated by big cats, wolves, or bears, despite the potential danger. Others splats I find pathetic, such as prometheans and mummies. I'm the kind of supernatural wanna-be who would walk up to mages, beasts, vampires, or changelings, and ask how to become one. Even werewolves or geists seem a better deal than being a puny mortal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1949,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1949-irioth","user":"Irioth","date":". 01-19-2017, 10:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1949-irioth","name":"Irioth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"566"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T06:55:49-08:00","id":1034569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1022153-scariest-fucker?p=1034397#post1034397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If a Changeling really wants to screw with you in 2e, it just makes two Goblin Vows with the right aspect of reality, 1 vow gets you as a retainer merit and the gets the merit is, True Friend: You, you now can't betray them and most obey them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm... pretty sure it doesn't work like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T08:16:27-08:00","id":1034614,"title":"","content":"Yeah, maybe for a mage, since they love to screw around with casuality like that, but Changelings are usually not that crazy powerful","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T08:33:40-08:00","id":1034619,"title":"","content":"I would have to say the Hosts are up there for me. I personally don't have a phobia of rats or spiders, but I don't like rats (especially when they crawl on you with their little beady feet). So imagining a rat that can gnaw its way into your body, pull a Brown Jenkin, and then turn your corpse into a &quot;party bus&quot; for all its friends is pretty fucking terrifying!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T09:24:18-08:00","id":1034652,"title":"","content":"EDIT: Wisdom won out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 01-19-2017, 01:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T14:55:09-08:00","id":1034881,"title":"","content":"In 2e Changeling Goblin Vows is a merit. So you can take Goblin Vows \u2022 (Internet Forumite). <br /> <br /> You then make a deal with the Wyrd in it's Internet Forumite aspect make Omegaphallic my slave for X amount of time and I will help devote a hour to helping people on Internet Forums every day for X amount of time. Bamph, you now have the retainer merit \u2022\u2022 (Omegaphallic). <br /> <br /> Then you make another deal, I will set up my own Internet Forum for Changelings for x amount of time and in exchange you will make my slave Omegaphallic into a loyal, true friend, and bamph you now have the True Friend \u2022\u2022\u2022 (Omegaphallic).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T17:04:16-08:00","id":1034948,"title":"","content":"for only X duration though","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T17:58:55-08:00","id":1034969,"title":"","content":"If going raw 'booga booga booga', then I would say the Azlu. I'm arachnophobic, so the idea of a giant spider crawling into your brain and hollowing it out is viscerally terrifying to me.<br /> <br /> If going by more subtle fear, then I would say, as others have, the Fetch. The sheer implications can drive you mad.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>GM of the <i>Walking Shadow</i> Campaigns</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/8992-the-hacks-and-houserules-of-walking-shadows\" target=\"_blank\">New System and Setting Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1040-neotiamat","name":"NeoTiamat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1040_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"471"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T20:23:23-08:00","id":1035032,"title":"","content":"The academic distance with which I generally consume the games' material makes it hard to pin down particular levels of relative scariness for me, but I find the God-Machine's more visceral aspects to be deeply unsettling, and the Insatiables' feeding methods are sufficiently horrifying that I wouldn't relish the prospect of existing in proximity to one.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1022153-scariest-fucker?p=1034881#post1034881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In 2e Changeling Goblin Vows is a merit. So you can take Goblin Vows \u2022 (Internet Forumite).</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not a Goblin Vow purview. People in general aren't subdomains of the Wyrd.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> You then make a deal with the Wyrd in it's Internet Forumite aspect make Omegaphallic my slave for X amount of time and I will help devote a hour to helping people on Internet Forums every day for X amount of time. Bamph, you now have the retainer merit \u2022\u2022 (Omegaphallic). </div> </div> </div>Also not how Goblin Vows work. The fatey nature of the Wyrd means you get <i>a</i> Retainer through means appropriate to the purview's capacity to leverage. &quot;Make this specific person my subordinate as represented by a Social Merit&quot; is out of the sphere of influence of most particular subdivisions of reality without multiple smaller deals supplementing gradual social maneuvering.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Then you make another deal, I will set up my own Internet Forum for Changelings for x amount of time and in exchange you will make my slave Omegaphallic into a loyal, true friend, and bamph you now have the True Friend \u2022\u2022\u2022 (Omegaphallic). </div> </div> </div>Extra no. It's a fuelstat-free power for changelings, not a super-Contract.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 01-19-2017, 11:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T21:49:24-08:00","id":1035064,"title":"","content":"Tough to say what scares me the most. I mean, as a rule, not a fan of a lot of things in the Chronicles world, lot of things I wouldn't want to come across. Hoard of spiders swarming allover me, devouring me into a convienent flesh suit? Yep. Being forced against my will to do horrible things to other people? Sure. The shattering of my deeply rooted connection to the illusions that allow me to sleep in peace, thus rendering me subject to the overload of primal, naked fear that would surely break me down into nothing more than a mere rabbit? You betcha.<br /> <br /> But honestly, the thing that scares me most are things that I'm also realistically going to come across, which is funny, because my initial reaction to it is actually anger rather than fear: short sighted, self-unaware assholes who think they have everything figured out and deserve power because of course they do, who have no fear of the world or of self, blinded by their own fucking ego and the delusions they've been feeding themselves to rise over their own pettiness, frailty, and fear. And while my response is anger, it stems from the fear that assholes like that are going to hurt people and never give a shit because they are wrapped up in their own self-affirming prattle. It scares me because I know way too many people like this, and there's no real changing their point of view until they confront their weakness and fear-and unfortunately, in our world, so many of them will never actually connect to the things that will scare the fucking shit out of them.<br /> <br /> Fear and doubt are healthy, fuckers. Embrace it before the world cracks your ego like an egg.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T07:54:35-08:00","id":1035223,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1022153-scariest-fucker?p=1034881#post1034881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In 2e Changeling Goblin Vows is a merit. So you can take Goblin Vows \u2022 (Internet Forumite).<br /> <br /> You then make a deal with the Wyrd in it's Internet Forumite aspect make Omegaphallic my slave for X amount of time and I will help devote a hour to helping people on Internet Forums every day for X amount of time. Bamph, you now have the retainer merit \u2022\u2022 (Omegaphallic).<br /> <br /> Then you make another deal, I will set up my own Internet Forum for Changelings for x amount of time and in exchange you will make my slave Omegaphallic into a loyal, true friend, and bamph you now have the True Friend \u2022\u2022\u2022 (Omegaphallic).</div> </div> </div> </div>I understand the mechanics - I think you can't define that degree of specificity for Goblin Vow benefits. In you example, you could probably get <i>a</i> forumite, but not whichever one you want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T15:42:48-08:00","id":1035492,"title":"","content":"Does anything in the merit say that it has to be general, that it can't be specific?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T15:50:37-08:00","id":1035494,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1022153-scariest-fucker?p=1035032#post1035032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The academic distance with which I generally consume the games' material makes it hard to pin down particular levels of relative scariness for me, but I find the God-Machine's more visceral aspects to be deeply unsettling, and the Insatiables' feeding methods are sufficiently horrifying that I wouldn't relish the prospect of existing in proximity to one.<br /> <br /> That's not a Goblin Vow purview. People in general aren't subdomains of the Wyrd.<br /> <br /> Also not how Goblin Vows work. The fatey nature of the Wyrd means you get <i>a</i> Retainer through means appropriate to the purview's capacity to leverage. &amp;quot;Make this specific person my subordinate as represented by a Social Merit&amp;quot; is out of the sphere of influence of most particular subdivisions of reality without multiple smaller deals supplementing gradual social maneuvering.<br /> <br /> Extra no. It's a fuelstat-free power for changelings, not a super-Contract.</div> </div> </div> </div> The purviews capacity to leverage IS internet forumites, Omegaphallic is an internet forumite, so he is directly in the preview of internet forumites. <br /> <br /> And nothing in the merit says subgroupings are not purviews of the Wyrd. You could have Elementary Teachers, Paid Assassins, Door to Door Salesmen, nothing in the merit prevents it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T16:04:49-08:00","id":1035497,"title":"","content":"I think the point is that you are not so valuable that you're not interchangeable with a thousand other folks on the internet.<br /> <br /> That and that's a stupid thing to get a fae dealing relationship when you could make a deal with, say, Secret Knowledge or Vicious Rumors. Like, Internet Forumites offer their minimal value pretty fucking easily(With all due love and respect to all you all internet forumites, y'all are amazing, but you don't compare to some of the things you can make Goblin Vows with, let's be honest).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T17:14:38-08:00","id":1035534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1022153-scariest-fucker?p=1035497#post1035497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the point is that you are not so valuable that you're not interchangeable with a thousand other folks on the internet.<br /> <br /> That and that's a stupid thing to get a fae dealing relationship when you could make a deal with, say, Secret Knowledge or Vicious Rumors. Like, Internet Forumites offer their minimal value pretty fucking easily(With all due love and respect to all you all internet forumites, y'all are amazing, but you don't compare to some of the things you can make Goblin Vows with, let's be honest).</div> </div> </div> </div> True, but if the deal specified it was a particular mortal that happened to fall under the preview, I see no reason it wouldn't work. It could be an interesting plot line, get the Changeling to break the Goblin Vow to free the person from they're influence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T17:30:28-08:00","id":1035545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1022153-scariest-fucker?p=1035534#post1035534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> True, but if the deal specified it was a particular mortal that happened to fall under the preview, I see no reason it wouldn't work. It could be an interesting plot line, get the Changeling to break the Goblin Vow to free the person from they're influence.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except that's a stupid understanding of how the merit works, and we're deviating from the entire scariest fucker conversation asides.<br /> <br /> If you wanna continue this convo, take it to the changeling forum. We can tell you how you're wrong there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 01-20-2017, 09:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-20T20:36:24-08:00","id":1035602,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1022153-scariest-fucker?p=1035494#post1035494\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The purviews capacity to leverage IS internet forumites, Omegaphallic is an internet forumite, so he is directly in the preview of internet forumites.</div> </div> </div> </div>He is in the purview of Internet Forumites to <i>influence</i>, and if there was a Contract with Internet Forumites (what effect does that even have on your mien?) and he was a valid target for its use then that would matter, but you don't get to declare people your slaves with Goblin Vow any more than you get to do so by just spending Experiences to buy the Retainer Merit. A deal to get a particular person's help or loyalty via a Goblin Vow works by enhancing your ability to convince that person to help you and be loyal to you \u2014 it's not an exchange of favor for Retainer.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And nothing in the merit says subgroupings are not purviews of the Wyrd. You could have Elementary Teachers, Paid Assassins, Door to Door Salesmen, nothing in the merit prevents it. </div> </div> </div>The Merit operates as a more diffused basis of supernatural oathbinding than those aspects of the Wyrd that allow a changeling to internalize a Contract, the given examples of valid purviews map with moderately high fidelity to those of its 1e basis, and its 1e basis saw fit to divide its explicit list of examples into categories that quite conspicuously lacks peoples and professions among its subheadings. The Wyrd is not a human force and you have regular Social Merits to accomplish feats of social engineering through status and networking.<br /> <br /> It's fae magic \u2014 the stuff lets you accomplish feats by talking to the abstract, the inanimate, and the inhuman, and the things those aspects of the Wyrd can do on your behalf are bound by what they are. Nothing about the storybook-logic capabilities of the abstract phenomenon of Internet Forumites (or Internet Forums, for that matter) lets you instantaneously subordinate a person to your will and turn them into a steadfast ally and pillar of moral support, and expecting it to work that way just on the basis of doesn't-say is only a few steps removed from the shenanigans of taking Meat as an element for Control Elements. These powers do not exist in a vacuum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-21T05:27:25-08:00","id":1035683,"title":"","content":"You can take wood as an element, so meat isn't so out there, and a Balony or Salami elemental sounds fun. Crap I'm hungry now. <br /> <br /> Arc is right this is becoming thread drift, so I'll refocus on topic. <br /> <br /> A demon from the Inferno possessing you and pushing you to do things you know are wrong would be scary because you can't run away, its inside you so there is no getting away from it, no fleeing, the danger to you and others is always present.<br /> <br /> Most other things you can run from.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-29T17:40:46-08:00","id":1040316,"title":"","content":"Demons and mages can pretty much do whatever they want with me, so that's a bit of existential horror. Vampires could be anyone, anywhere, and I would never know. Werewolves and slashers could rip me to pieces. Changelings could do any of those things, or all of them.<br /> <br /> I dunno, everything in the world of darkness is terrifying. Probably actually the god-machine though. That whatever is nasty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10751-belac93","name":"Belac93","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10751_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}